  "details": "I have seen so many people advertise on their bio that they are looking for erp, advertising their only fans, and even payed erp, using many slurs, talking about their sexual position in bed, talking about their kinks, and a lot of very reportable things are in people’s bios and statuses. I have seen some very disturbing statuses and if you’re like me you see statuses on people nameplates. \nPeople also use slashes( we’ve all seen this /\\/ ), symbols/fonts and other things to censor what they’re saying to bypass reports.\nThese people are almost always trusted users as well. It’s really unsettling to see these kinds of things in public worlds when this is a 13+ game and kids are everywhere. \nI don’t know how to report these things other than reporting text but there’s no option to report profiles other than reporting their pictures. It’s really confusing and would be very useful. \nExample:\n•profile\n    -image, sexual/harassing/hateful \n    -bio, sexual/harassing/hateful \n    -status, sexual/harassing/hateful \nTLDR:\n•add a report profile option on the report menu",
